      "id": "claim_5a40abeabd6f4532b7c31d8cb7e35e3d",
      "statement": "The disk cache pickles objects under <cache_dir>/objects with a JSON index, defaults to $XDG_CACHE_HOME/dtcc_agent (overridable by DTCC_AGENT_CACHE_DIR), expires entries after 168 hours and enforces a 10 GB budget by evicting oldest entries, with cleanup run at construction.",
